# Rust / Cargo
/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed: this crate ships binaries + examples, and a pinned
# lock makes `cargo build` / CI / the benchmark byte-reproducible. (Library
# consumers ignore our lock, so committing it costs them nothing.)

# Python bytecode from the tools/ harnesses
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Backtest outputs
trade_list.csv
*.log

# Synthetic data generated by examples/gen_synthetic.rs
data/SYNTHETIC.csv

# Local data overrides (uncomment if you want to keep data out of git)
# data/

# Auto-generated parity-harness scaffolding (written by tools/parity_*.py)
examples/_parity_*.rs

# Full-sweep transcripts (written by tools/sweep_all.sh)
.sweep/

# Bench harness output (written by tools/bench.py --out)
tools/bench_results.md
